{"version":1,"content":"<p>武漢地鐵12號線今日（29日）全線開通運營。</p><p>經中國城市軌道交通協會確認，該線路是國內目前最長地鐵環線，全長59.9公里，設37座地下車站，串聯武漢7個中心城區，銜接漢口站、武昌站兩大鐵路樞紐，可與18條既有及規劃線路換乘，跑完全程約96分鐘。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T04:21:26.598958+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T03:40:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T12:18:16.853953+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T04:18:10.520645+00:00","content_hash":"29e8dd9a3922255419036f69ba43f3b77f84768befc9dffe63f5595eca11a65a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}